<title>MEXICO: Mexico livestock export update to U.S. - USDA.</title>
<headline>Mexico livestock export update to U.S. - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Weekly livestock movement update of Mexico exports to United States, to Dec 31 - USDA.</p>
<p>(Livestock per head, year in Jan/Dec calendar year)</p>
<p>    Type			   Week	    Year    Year Ago</p>
<p>    Feeders		     2,843	  434,312  1,566 386</p>
<p>    Slaughter			 0		816     72,433</p>
